## Rust dependencies

Recorded by Cargo, not restated here. `cargo tree` and `cargo license`
give the current answer; a copy in this file would be stale within a
release.

The one dependency worth naming is `whisper-rs`, which builds
whisper.cpp — MIT, by Georgi Gerganov and contributors. It is why this
project needs a C++ toolchain and edge-ear does not.
